<para>Detected MIME type hint (default: &quot;text/plain&quot;). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>filename</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Filename hint used for profile selection (default: &quot;input.txt&quot;). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>Full assembled entity set; empty <computeroutput>BaseEntitySet</computeroutput> on failure.</para>
</simplesect>
